  "raw_label": "1",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Somning Alias Somnath Shivanna Pujari vs State Of Maharashtra on 3 July, 2023 Author: Anuja Prabhudessai Bench: Anuja Prabhudessai 2023:Bhc-As:18208 11_aba_1734_2 In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Criminal Appellate Jurisdiction Anticipatory Bail Application No.1734 Of 2023 Somning alias Somnath Shivanna Pujari ...Applicant Versus The State of Maharashtra ... Respondent ... Mr. Veerdhaval Kakade for the Applicant. Mr. R.M. Pethe, App for the Respondent -State. PHC-Yelpatte, Mangalvedha Police Station, present. Coram: Smt. Anuja Prabhudessai, J. Dated: 3rd July, 2023. P. C. :- 1.",
    "facts": "The aforesaid crime was registered pursuant to the FIR lodged by Food Safety Officer, Food and Drugs Administration, Solapur. The facts narrated in the FIR reveal that on 17/04/2023 the First Informant had received information that some prohibited goods were likely to be transported from Somning Alias Somnath Shivanna Pujari vs State Of Maharashtra on 3 July, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/44529116/ 1 Nipani to Maharashtra. Pursuant to the said information Vehicle No. MH-12-HD 7876 was intercepted. It is alleged that some plastic bags carrying Hira Pan Masala and scented tobacco (prohibited goods) were being transported by the said vehicle. Hence, crime came to be registered and the driver of the said vehicle was arrested. The driver informed that the said vehicle is owned by the Applicant herein. On the basis of the said information the Applicant came to be arrayed as an accused in the said crime.",
